      "changelog": "- Initial release of smart-sourcing skill for intelligent selection of sources.\n- Prioritizes citations for high-value factual claims; avoids sources for general concepts and common knowledge.\n- Includes a decision framework to determine when sourcing is required, when uncertainty markers are sufficient, and when no source is needed.\n- Provides inline citation, uncertainty marker, and confidence level guidelines for responses.\n- Integrates with related plugins for response compression, token conservation, and research workflows.",
